      "raw_response": "REFUTED\n\nThe abstract suggests that overexpression of KDM4E can restore the global transcriptome, improve blastocyst formation, and increase the cloning efficiency of SCNT embryos, which implies that KDM4E plays a crucial role in overcoming the challenges of reprogramming in SCNT experiments. This contradicts the claim that removal of H3K9me3 by ectopic expression of other H3K9 demethylases decreases reprogramming efficiency.",
